              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The petitioner argues that double\u2011jeopardy requires the Ohio post\u2011conviction court to hold a hearing on whether Mr.\u202fBies is mentally retarded under the Atkins rule."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "aed7b430a66a00ec606625ba7523a4caf9fe4b72b01677d4777e8f1965762fa5",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-aed7b430a66a-0000-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The petitioner notes that there has been no acquittal in this case."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "State",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "aed7b430a66a00ec606625ba7523a4caf9fe4b72b01677d4777e8f1965762fa5",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-aed7b430a66a-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The State contends that the record shows the defendant is mildly mentally retarded with an IQ of 69."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "aed7b430a66a00ec606625ba7523a4caf9fe4b72b01677d4777e8f1965762fa5",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-aed7b430a66a-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner, the petitioner raises a judicial\u2011estoppel issue, arguing that the writ should be dismissed as improvidently granted."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "aed7b430a66a00ec606625ba7523a4caf9fe4b72b01677d4777e8f1965762fa5",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-aed7b430a66a-0002-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
